  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 101.34 “Normal pool” means the water surface level of an impoundment when the water level is at the elevation of the primary outlet structure or spillway.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wr 100) #13979, eff 5-24-24",
